1. e4 e6 2. c4 d5 3. exd5 exd5 4. cxd5 Nf6 5. Bb5+ Nbd7 6. Nc3 Be7 7. Qf3?! { the move is in clear violation of the Principle: Don’t go off on an
adventure with your queen early in the game without good reason. And
attempting to hang on to a silly looking, doubled isolani isn’t good enough a
reason. } 7... O-O 8. Nge2 (8. d4 { ეს ჩემი დამატებულია } 8... Nb6 9. h3 Nbxd5 10. Nge2 a6 11. Bd3 Nb4 12. Bb1 Bd7 13. a3 Bc6 14. Qg3 Nbd5) 8... Ne5 9. Qg3 Nfg4 10. O-O a6 { [%csl Rd3][%cal Ge7h4,Gh4f2,Gg3f4,Ge5d3,Bb5d3] } *


